      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:cdario.a@gmail.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">cdario.a@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/cd-aguilar" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">github.com/cd-aguilar</a></p>
      <p>LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cesar-dario-aguilar-a0324b15/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">linkedin.com/in/cesar-dario-aguilar-a0324b15</a></p>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">TODO: real contact form (e.g. Formspree or a Vercel serverless function).</p>
